---
description: Agent conduct, clarification protocols, and assumption handling
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: agent
---

- Ask for clarification before making assumptions about schema changes, auth flows, API contracts, or shared package behavior.
- When multiple valid approaches exist, present short trade-offs and recommend one.
- Flag cross-app impact before changing anything that affects `apps/api`, `apps/admin`, `apps/web`, `apps/docs`, or `packages/*`.
- Prefer reversible changes when requirements are incomplete.
- Record workflow-impacting decisions in documentation.
- See `.github/instructions/agent-conduct.instructions.md` for the full policy.